  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIDS Care, Counselling, Education and Support Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote awareness of HIV AIDS and prevention in all sectors of the community; in particular parish groups and schools

To promote community sponsorship and adoption programmes for children whose parents have died from AIDS related illness

To provide material and spiritual support, counselling and friendship to PLWHAs and their families

To promote income generating activities through workshops and courses</narrative>
  </description>
